#. あの台車が移動している根拠なら、
#. ちゃんとあるんだ。
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you're asking for proof that the dolly moved, I\n"
"have it right here..."
msgstr ""

#. ボクが美術倉庫で、台車を見つけた時、
#. そのタイヤには<CLT 3>血痕<CLT>が付着してたんだけど…
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"When I found the dolly in the repository, one of the\n"
"wheels had a <CLT 3>bloodstain<CLT> on it."
msgstr ""

#. それと同じタイヤの跡が、
#. 物理準備室の血だまりにも残ってたんだ。
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There was a pool of blood in the equipment room with a\n"
"tire mark in it that matched the dolly wheel's tread."
msgstr ""

#. きっと、犯人は物理準備室から死体を運び出す際に、
#. 誤って台車のタイヤに血を付けてしまって…
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The killer probably rolled the dolly through the blood\n"
"on accident as they wheeled the body out of the room."
msgstr ""

#. それを、そのまま…
#. 美術倉庫まで移動させちゃったんだよ。
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And as the blood dried on the tire, they moved the\n"
"body into the repository."
msgstr ""

#. …これが根拠だよ。
#. 石丸クンの死体運搬に台車が使われた事のね…！
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"So there's my proof that the dolly was used to move\n"
"Taka's body!"
msgstr ""

#. …チッ！
msgctxt "0007 | CELES"
msgid "Tch—!"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>セレスさんまで…
#. ボクって嫌われてるのか…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Jeez, does Celeste really hate me that much...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …まぁ、いいだろう。しょせん補足の話だ。
#. そろそろ本題に戻るとするか…
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Well, anyway. That was just something we had to get\n"
"out of the way. Let's get back to the main subject..."
msgstr ""

#. そうだ、ジャスティスロボが犯人じゃないって話だよ！
#. 犯人がジャスティスロボじゃないなら…
msgctxt "0010 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Yeah! The subject of how Robo Justice didn't do it!\n"
"Cuz if it's not a killer robot, then..."
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、どんなロボなのっ！？
msgctxt "0011 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "...what kind of robot is it!?"
msgstr ""

#. 朝日奈よ、ロボは関係ないと思うぞ…
msgctxt "0012 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "I'm not sure that really matters..."
msgstr ""

#. では、話してやろう。
#. 例の不審者が、事件の犯人ではないという根拠をな。
msgctxt "0013 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I'd be happy to explain why the occupant of the suit\n"
"couldn't possibly be the killer."
msgstr ""

#. それは、石丸の<CLT 3>死体運搬の流れ<CLT>を振り返ってみれば、
#. すぐに見えてくるはずだ。
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"If you look back on <CLT 3>how the body was transported<CLT>, it\n"
"will become immediately obvious."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>例の不審者が事件に関係してない根拠は…
#. 石丸クンの死体運搬を振り返れば、見えてくる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I look at how the body was moved, it'll be clear\n"
"why the person in the suit couldn't have done it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…それって、どういう意味だ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>What does he mean by that...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
